{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12379","headline":"过瑞龙观道士 · 钱起","name":"过瑞龙观道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不知谁氏子，链魄家洞天。\n鹤待成丹日，人寻种杏田。\n灵山含道气，物性皆自然。\n白鹿顾瑞草，骊龙蟠玉泉。\n得兹象外趣，便割区中缘。\n石窦采云母，霞堂陪列仙。\n主人善止客，柯烂忘归年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}